 "title": "NYC's 2008 Science Festival",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🧪",
 "sentences": [
  "New York City hosted its first science festival.",
  "Physicist Brian Greene and journalist Tracy Day founded it.",
  "The 2008 event featured panel discussions and multimedia presentations.",
  "A family program explored science through sports.",
  "Actor Alan Alda led a cultural program about science-inspired art.",
  "The festival included a summit with leaders from science, politics, and business.",
  "Partners like the Metropolitan Museum of Art helped bring it to life."
